


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_58de5c9e:


    "把文给围起来的女生们接二连三地提出了问题，看来这个讲习会还得再继续开一阵了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_d5b2e9e2:


    "而阳菜她们仨则是远望着这副光景。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_c0951ba3:



    voice "2HI_0681"
    hina "「伦在情人节打算怎么样？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_22d9dbf1:



    voice "2RI_0692"
    rin "「你说的怎么样，是指？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_3c948837:



    voice "2HI_0682"
    hina "「因为我没办法想象伦一脸严肃地送别人巧克力的样子啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_9be45a71:



    voice "2RI_0693"
    rin "「真是失礼啊。你可不可以不要把我困在你自己那贫乏的想象力之中呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_42541f16:



    voice "2HI_0683"
    hina "「抱歉。原来你有要送的啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_c94e5fbb:



    voice "2RI_0694"
    rin "「没打算送哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_50652470:



    voice "2HI_0684"
    hina "「喂！那你干嘛还否定啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_5fc68b46:



    voice "2RI_0695"
    rin "「总觉得跟阳菜所想象的一致的话，会挺不爽的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_8c219595:



    voice "2HI_0685"
    hina "「你这人还真是有够扭曲的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_7e678eb5:



    voice "2RI_0696"
    rin "「虽然不会送，但我会收喔」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_3fd1e913:



    voice "2MI_0543"
    miyako "「哦哦，挺受欢迎的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_8e531c64:



    voice "2RI_0697"
    rin "「每年我都有收到相当数量的巧克力的，不过因为不喜欢吃甜食所以都囤在一边了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_9486a22b:



    voice "2MI_0544"
    miyako "「真浪费啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_62a1c0b4:



    voice "2RI_0698"
    rin "「那阳菜你呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_8720c38d:



    voice "2HI_0686"
    hina "「吃掉啊——喂，怎么就肯定我是收的那一个？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_23a1777f:



    voice "2RI_0699"
    rin "「行啦，那不也挺好的吗。白色情人节的时候呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_49c2a67c:



    voice "2HI_0687"
    hina "「用手制饼干回礼哦。不过说是那么说，其实还是让我姐姐帮我做的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_e00df8df:



    voice "2RI_0700"
    rin "「真了得啊。我的话就是送购物卡来回礼了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_0f30c0da:



    voice "2HI_0688"
    hina "「我都快对你没脾气了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_d1baa340:



    voice "2RI_0701"
    rin "「总之，我打算今后谢绝掉所有情人节巧克力之类的东西了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_92b9c8b8:



    voice "2MI_0545"
    miyako "「咦，是那样吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_7bb23868:



    voice "2RI_0702"
    rin "「因为今年开始收本命巧克力了嘛～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_c647fd1c:


    "伦说着并将视线往“讲习会”的方向移去。正好文也和这边对上了视线。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_ccdcc2c0:


    "然后伦稍微挥了挥手，文也在女生的包围之下向伦稍作回应示意。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_d600f553:



    voice "2HI_0689"
    hina "「什么啊，你个晒妻狂魔」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_e24cb66a:



    voice "2RI_0703"
    rin "「没错。综上所述也就不用劳驾阳菜送我巧克力了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_65fd2988:


    "伦对阳菜做了个掌心向外的拒绝手势。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_ddc3ac24:



    voice "2HI_0690"
    hina "「打一开始我就没打算送你。你不是不喜欢吃甜食吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_145f23f5:



    voice "2RI_0704"
    rin "「文送我的巧克力是特别的嘛。说是特意为我做的专属口味」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_1768f27e:



    voice "2MI_0546"
    miyako "「把甜度给降低了吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_69eb83fd:



    voice "2RI_0705"
    rin "「嗯。不过我和文倒是甜甜蜜蜜的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_d0bd03ba:



    voice "2HI_0691"
    hina "「啊……无名火起」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_9eb70742:



    voice "2RI_0706"
    rin "「好啦别嫉妒别嫉妒」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_1bf221e7:



    voice "2MI_0547"
    miyako "「那伦你送什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_63dfb2f3:



    voice "2RI_0707"
    rin "「哈？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_aa837a22:



    voice "2HI_0692"
    hina "「所以说啦。姑且你也是个女生，那不是也应该送巧克力吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_7a58a04d:



    voice "2RI_0708"
    rin "「唉。阳菜是个笨蛋啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_51271b26:


    "伦摇了摇头。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_f5c233b2:



    voice "2HI_0693"
    hina "「笨蛋是什么意思啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_dcbbc854:



    voice "2RI_0709"
    rin "「要知道现状是要送怎么样的巧克力才能让一个糕点师的女儿高兴哦？那可是个突然就在教室里开起了讲习会的女生哦？送个半吊子的巧克力只会让人笑掉大牙吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_6546b889:



    voice "2HI_0694"
    hina "「不对，我认为浅生才不会笑你的。难度虽然是高了点，但重要的难道不是心意吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_789e788b:



    voice "2RI_0710"
    rin "「这点我想是有想过啦。只是暂时还没有什么头绪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_8da0848b:



    voice "2HI_0695"
    hina "「不，只要你别想些太奇葩的点子应该就没问题了。简单点去买一个怎么样？在浅生她家以外的店买」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_8acb0ef3:



    voice "2RI_0711RE"
    rin "「啊，要不要将丝带系在我身上然后把自己给送过去呢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_ee389179:



    voice "2HI_0696"
    hina "「……笨蛋啊这家伙是」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_22aefe62:



    voice "2RI_0712"
    rin "「笨蛋是什么意思啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_c04ed4ae:


    "真是有够要好啊，这几个女孩。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_2b3c28ca:



    voice "2FU_0546"
    fumi "「喂喂。你们两个不要摆出那么可怕的表情呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_696e41f9:


    "说着说着文回来了。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_3d5fb976:



    voice "2RI_0713"
    rin "「啊，文」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_587db7d0:



    voice "2HI_0697"
    hina "「啊，浅生」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_d15b4795:



    voice "2FU_0547"
    fumi "「抱歉，让你们久等了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_ad01c64a:



    voice "2MI_0548"
    miyako "「辛苦你啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_a088007c:



    voice "2FU_0548"
    fumi "「因为总是找不到时机结束话题所以拖了这么久。跟她们说好了下次我给她们个简单的配方然后才散场的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_da7def40:



    voice "2MI_0549"
    miyako "「大家对情人节的热情真是如火如荼呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_3a3f0e1d:



    voice "2FU_0549"
    fumi "「那毕竟是因为，都是女孩子嘛！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_8c2bcd58:



    voice "2MI_0550"
    miyako "「噢噢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_847c18e6:


    "那样自豪地说着的文两眼闪闪地发着亮光。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_e0d07e76:



    voice "2RI_0714"
    rin "「……话说，巧克力，你收到过多少个？我最多一次是收到了50个」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_438561d8:



    voice "2HI_0698"
    hina "「一万个」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_40e8241f:



    voice "2RI_0715"
    rin "「为什么啊！市内的巧克力价位都会大暴涨了吧！文～阳菜她在说谎啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_8a27e048:


    "——毕竟是女生对吧？"




translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_a927bbd2:


    voice "2RI_0709"


translate simplified_chinese a08_cou3_01_465a41c2:


    rin "「要知道现状是要送怎么样的巧克力才能让一个糕点师的女儿高兴哦？那可是个突然就在教室里开起了讲习会的女生哦？送个半吊子的巧克力只会让人笑掉大牙吧」"
